+#### .pruneExpired()
+
+Remove all currently visible expired items from the cache and return the number of logical keys removed.
+
+Expired items are removed using the `onEviction` callback when configured. Live items keep their existing iteration order. If a current item shadows an old item for the same key, only the current item determines visibility.
+
 #### .resize(maxSize)
 
 Update the `maxSize`, discarding items as necessary. Insertion order is mostly preserved, though this is not a strong guarantee.
